OL,5,G1900 The Box
OL,6,     FAn exasperating challenge sparks
OL,7,     Fconflict and chaos, and tempers
OL,8,     Fflare as accusations fly, with a
OL,9,     Fonce-solid friendship being pushed
OL,10,     Fto breaking point. With tensions
OL,11,     Fstill simmering, the celebrities
OL,12,     Fare thrown into an
OL,13,     Fanxiety-inducing setting and
OL,14,     Ftested under watchful eyes, and
OL,15,     Fwith just five determined
OL,16,     Fcontenders left fighting for a
OL,17,     Fplace in the semi-final, the stage
OL,18,     Fis set for a tense, giant-killing
OL,19,     FDuel
